[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=22 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="返港时，堤道上的椅子换了根新绳。老人仍坐在原来的地方，见你们经过，举了举手里的杯子。你看见杯里的水越过了那道刻线。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="平台的水还在？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="老人"

text="在。昨天漏了一次，来人修好了。你们是不是又去很远的地方了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不算远。带回一堆要慢慢读的纸。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="男孩从厨房钻出来，问你名字想好没有。你拿出那半截带牙印的铅笔给他看，说还没有。他想了想，说那就继续借你，反正他已经有新的一支。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山在办公室等，但她说你们可以先去吃饭。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="她终于学会了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="她一直会。这次大概是终于记得先说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们把档案送进临时保管室，逐页签交接。轮到你时，你在名字栏写下“第五队临时指挥”，后面加了今天的日期。你知道那不是过去的答案，但它准确地记着现在。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="下一步我会开放原件供维修班核对。涉及个人的记录先找当事人，不把寻人名单直接挂到广播里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="包括你知道的那一部分？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="包括。你可以问，我也可以有需要时间才能说的话。不同的是，我会告诉你我是在等，而不是让你以为没有这件事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你点点头。潮痕放下一本没有封面的笔记，翻到她说要给你看的那页。上面只有一段很日常的话：炉子坏了，晚饭去隔壁。字后画了个小箭头。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "fletcher", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="她留下的不只有拒绝。还有这些。我以前总嫌它们不重要。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="现在呢？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="现在我想先查隔壁是谁家。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="门外有人叫德雷顿去搬毯子，说晒了一天，再不收又要下雨。她跑到走廊，跑一半折回来，问你今晚还开不开灯。你说先开着，等大家睡稳了再关。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="行。别忘了明天轮到你洗碗。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="海图还没有画完，桌上甚至多了几处新的空白。你把两截铅笔排好，一截留给自己，一截留在别人够得着的地方，然后跟着她们去吃迟了很久的晚饭。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "sanfrancisco"])

actor_tones={}

